    rdfs:comment 'Indicates whether this is continuation coverage under Consolidated Omnibus Budget Reconciliation Act (COBRA), state continuation, or Health Insurance Portability and Accountability Act (HIPAA) portability.' ;
    rdfs:domain ind:Coverage ;
