    rdfs:comment 'Primary regulatory or compliance framework that this policy version addresses, such as HIPAA (Health Insurance Portability and Accountability Act), ACA (Affordable Care Act), ERISA (Employee Retirement Income Security Act), or SOX (Sarbanes-Oxley Act).' ;
